OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests after fire kills
OL,4,Atwo including child
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 23 and 31, have been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of murder and are
OL,8,Fin police custody, the force said.
